丸い形が良いです)\n・腹ボコはなしでお願いします。\n・おっぱいは実際のキャラデザインと同じか少し大きいくらいでお願いします。\n・男体の一部が写っていれば問題ありません。\n・背景は劇中に出てくる祭壇か、シンプルに岩場でお願いします\n・全裸で事後の差分もあると嬉しいです。\nご一考お願いします。\n\n\n\n参考1 フルーラと花飾り\nhttps://blog-imgs-85-origin.2nt.com/w/a/r/warotalog/neEOw9f.jpg\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/88793217\n\nhttps://rule34.xxx/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=3879693\n\n参考2祭壇\n\nhttps://m.imdb.com/title/tt0210234/mediaviewer/rm2659513857/\n\nへそ参考\n\nhttps://livedoor.blogimg.jp/heso_suki/imgs/8/7/87e536f1.jpg", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 43569, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "りよ☕️", "screen_name": "Liyocafe", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1910203683641647105/rB76lrWj.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/969535290636361728/1761772775/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 113211, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "鏡植草 🔞", "screen_name": "_Do_t", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1113947216417177600/j3FN1Wyq.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/62242986/1677200223/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 726789, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "マクジラ@skeb受付中", "screen_name": "makuzira364", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/pro